	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et pacem a deo patre per dominum Iesum Christum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Perpensa tua erga nos humanitate, vir doctissime, et consi<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>deratis condiccionibus<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">= Condictionibus.</note>, quibus per te admoniti infelicissimo <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>non recipiendo Interim, non possumus non tui semper <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>esse memores, presertim cum tot pericula, de quibus per <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>te avisati,<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Briefe <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> an <persName ref="p1120">Jakob Fehr</persName> sind nicht erhalten.</note> cottidie cernimus ingruere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Heu, quantus piorum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>eiulatus!</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Sacramenta, presertim baptismus, adempta.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Christi verbum sincerissime hactenus predicamus; speramus <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>fore, ut cenam dominicam, maximo attamen periculo<note type="misc">Am Rande nachgetragen: "id est dei hostium"</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>brevi celebraturi simus.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Machinantur crudelia in <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>nos papiste, invertunt nostros sermones, defferunt nos, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>nugantur, excogitant more suo[?] infanda in nos quibus<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>vis nos insimulantes, ut tandem ex urbe protrudant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Nostre partis zelo dei ferventes plures, gratia deo, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>habemus, qui in hisce erumnosis casibus ardentiores <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>effecti omnem metum exuerunt, qui oppetere mortem <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>mallent quam infelix illud Interim pati.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Paucissimi <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>sunt, qui missam adeunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Sermones papistarum fastidiu<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ntur ferme ab omnibus; omnes sapiunt sibi strui insidias, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>tendicule, quibus irretire simplicium animos satt<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>agunt, perspecte sunt in universum singulas[!], illuduntur, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>spernuntur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Nemo, qui honorem eis exhibeat (ut <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>parr est).</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Id cernentes miseri papiste minantur <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>nobis cesaris<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> indignationem, urbem presidiariis <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>occupaturum, e medio quosdam gladio ex nostris <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>sublaturum; siciunt sanguinem nostrum; manent, si <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>res pro votu suo successerit, nos horrenda mala.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Sed <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>nos freti dei nostri benignitate meliora nobis pollic<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>emur etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Varii sparguntur hincinde rumores: <lb xml:id="p1z30"/><persName ref="p18538">Cesarem</persName> grandem parare exercitum contra <placeName ref="l862">Helvecios</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>et patriam nostram; ferunt quidam eundem <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>brevi <placeName ref="l491">Argentinam</placeName><note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><placeName ref="l491">Straßburg</placeName>.</note> cum <placeName ref="l875">Hyspanica</placeName> sua fece venturum <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>et istic consulturum, quibus racionibus possit ado<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>riri negocium.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Dominus dissipet consilia eorum et convertat <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>corda nostra ad se, uti penitencia scelerum nostrorum ducti <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>resipiscamus iramque suam propellamus!</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Hec sunt, que <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>pro mea erga te gratitudine te scire volui.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale et <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>me tibi commendatum habe.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta meo nomine <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>cum ceteris fratribus meis.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l291">Lindaugia</placeName> nostra, 12. octobris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Rescribe, si liceat, vel saltem <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>tribus verbis, si quid habes.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Tuus ex animo <persName ref="p1120">Iacobus Fer</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Pyetate et multiiuga erudicione prestanti viro <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>domino M. <persName ref="p495">Hainrico Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>suo Mecenat<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>i colendissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
